    "title": "dotnet-tool-secrets-scan",
    "version": "1.0.1",
    "description": ".NET-first hardcoded-secret scanner. Detects secrets in source files and git history; reports location only — never values. Install with: dotnet tool install -g dotnet-tool-secrets-scan. Not to be confused with dotnet user-secrets."
